00:46:52.933 --> 00:47:09.166
Jilat yang banyak. Aaaa. Enak?

00:47:10.133 --> 00:47:11.200
Enak sekali.

00:47:11.500 --> 00:47:12.500
Nih.

00:47:13.533 --> 00:47:14.866
Aaaa.

00:47:18.800 --> 00:47:19.800
Aaaa.

00:47:22.666 --> 00:47:23.666
Aaaa.

00:47:31.200 --> 00:47:36.633
Aaaa. Mau dengar suara memekku?

00:47:37.566 --> 00:47:38.566
Iya.

00:47:38.666 --> 00:47:39.666
Aku ingin dengar.

00:47:42.933 --> 00:47:44.700
Dengarkan baik-baik ya.

00:47:45.133 --> 00:47:51.966
Iya. Dengar suara becek memekku?

00:47:53.200 --> 00:47:54.200
Dengar ya.

