00:48:11.300 --> 00:48:12.300
Iya.

00:48:12.566 --> 00:48:14.466
Mau minum. Mau minum cairan memek?

00:48:15.866 --> 00:48:16.866
Mau minum.

00:48:19.000 --> 00:48:20.600
Gimana ya.

00:48:23.333 --> 00:48:25.033
Cairan memek.

00:48:26.100 --> 00:48:29.100
Ya sudah, hari ini spesial, aku jilat banyak-banyak ya.

00:48:29.700 --> 00:48:42.833
Terima kasih. Enak?

00:48:42.833 --> 00:48:44.166
Enak?

00:48:46.066 --> 00:48:48.066
Kok mukamu sampai segitunya.

00:48:49.200 --> 00:48:50.200
Jilat.

00:48:50.500 --> 00:49:13.000
Bersihkan ya. Cuma mau hadiah cairan memek saja?

00:49:17.300 --> 00:49:20.333
