Apa?

00:54:23.233 --> 00:54:24.900
Enak sekali.

00:54:25.633 --> 00:54:45.233
Keluarin aja sepuasnya hari ini. Nih. Enak?

00:54:45.700 --> 00:54:46.900
Enak.

00:54:48.433 --> 00:54:49.433
Oh?

00:54:52.900 --> 00:54:53.900
Mu...

